/**
 * State-program templates (added 2026-10-16, directed by James).
 *
 * Each template is built from the state's PUBLISHED assessment
 * criteria — never presented as the state's official instrument
 * unless the state publishes that instrument:
 * - pa: PCCD School Safety & Security Assessment Criteria (Act 44),
 *   Physical Criteria Revised 2025 (items 1–225, leveled L1–L3) +
 *   Student Assistance / Behavioral Health criteria (Tiers T1–T3).
 *   Checkpoint `num` carries the PCCD item number and level.
 * - va: DCJS School Safety Inspection Checklist, Updated 2025
 *   Edition — the six CPTED zones of Section 4.
 * - tx: Texas School Safety Standards, 19 TAC §61.1031, plus the
 *   TEA/TxSSC intruder detection audit (IDA) focus areas.
 * - ky: MODELED on the published assessment areas of KRS
 *   158.4410(6)(a)–(h) and measures named by the State School
 *   Security Marshal. Kentucky's own compliance tool is NOT
 *   published (open-records exempt), so this is a statute-based
 *   template, not the state's checklist.
 * - tn: MODELED on the published process requirements of TCA
 *   §49-6-4302(f) and the required school safety plan components.
 *   The Dept. of Safety's assessment tool is NOT published.
 *
 * Every checkpoint carries an explicit negative `gap` statement so
 * findings derived from a "no" answer never echo the positive
 * criterion wording (same convention as lib/templates.ts).
 */
